    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About 100× faster than Bluetooth. Your Mac joins the recorder's own Wi‑Fi and is offline for about a minute, then reconnects to your usual network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比蓝牙快约 100 倍。Mac 会临时加入录音豆自己的 Wi‑Fi，断网约一分钟，之后自动连回原来的网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About this recorder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow typing into other apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许打字到其他 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any OpenAI-compatible server works: llama.cpp (llama-server), Ollama, LM Studio. It removes filler words, fixes likely homophones using your word list and keeps your wording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持任意 OpenAI 兼容服务：llama.cpp（llama-server）、Ollama、LM Studio。会去掉口头禅、按个人词表纠正同音字，并保留你的说法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking the recorder to start its Wi‑Fi…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
