            "value": "设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Short pauses finalise a phrase; slightly longer ones become a comma, longer ones a full stop. A too-short phrase pause chops sentences and hurts accuracy. Restart OpenBean after changing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "短停顿定稿一句；稍长的停顿补逗号，更长的补句号。定稿停顿太短会把一句话切碎、错字变多。修改后需重启 OpenBean。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show dictation clips": {
      "localizations": {
